<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.KOREA'S SUNKYONG GROUP RAISES '97 SALES TARGET.</title>
<headline>S.KOREA'S SUNKYONG GROUP RAISES '97 SALES TARGET.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Sunkyong Group said on Monday it had raised its 1997 sales target to 40 trillion won from an earlier 36 trillion won.</p>
<p>The group's sales were 31 trillion won in 1996, a group spokesman said.</p>
</text>
